        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "M'baa wa masikari uendasikira huwo, ukamghendia m'baa wa majeshi ukamzera, “Kuamba kubonye wada? Uja mundu ni mkitina wa Roma.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko m'baa wa majeshi ukacha ukamzera Paulo, “Nighorie, oho ko mkitina wa Roma?” Paulo ukatumbulia, “Hee.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uja m'baa wa majeshi ukaghamba, “Ini nereghueghe wukitina ughu kwa pesa nyingi.” Paulo ukamzera, “Ini neevalwa mkitina.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko awo weambaa wimkotie wikainjika shwa-shwa; na m'baa wa majeshi wori ukaobua angu wachamanya Paulo ni mkitina wa Roma, na sena wamfunga na minyororo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paulo imbiri ya mwandu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
